"></i></button></div></div><p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mb-4">Dejá una celda <strong>vacía</strong> para que acepte cualquier valor — se guarda como <code class="font-mono">*</code>. Gana la fila que resuelva más columnas con un valor exacto.</p><div class="border border-slate-200 rounded-lg p-4 mb-4"><h4 class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-600 uppercase mb-3">Editar fila</h4><div class="flex flex-wrap items-end gap-3"><div class="min-w-[10rem] flex-1"><div class="w-full"><label for="_r_ID_" class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 mb-1.5">Zona de origen</label><div class="relative"><input id="_r_ID_" class="w-full px-3 py-2 text-sm border border-slate-200 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal-500 focus:border-transparent transition-all   " placeholder="cualquiera" list="rt-RT_ZONAS_VE-originZone" value="CAR"></div></div><datalist id="rt-RT_ZONAS_VE-originZone"><option value="CCS"></option><option value="MCBO"></option></datalist></div><div class="min-w-[10rem] flex-1"><div class="w-full"><label for="_r_ID_" class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 mb-1.5">Zona de destino</label><div class="relative"><input id="_r_ID_" class="w-full px-3 py-2 text-sm border border-slate-200 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal-500 focus:border-transparent transition-all   " placeholder="cualquiera" list="rt-RT_ZONAS_VE-destZone" value="ZUL"></div></div><datalist id="rt-RT_ZONAS_VE-destZone"><option value="CCS"></option><option value="MCBO"></option></datalist></div><div class="min-w-[8rem]"><div class="w-full"><label for="_r_ID_" class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 mb-1.5">Importe *</label><div class="relative"><input id="_r_ID_" class="w-full px-3 py-2 text-sm border border-slate-200 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal-500 focus:border-transparent transition-all   " placeholder="1250.00" value="500.00"></div></div></div><div class="flex gap-2 pb-0.5"><button class="whitespace-nowrap 